@startuml
title LogiSense Demo Lite - Deployment Diagram

node "Developer Machine" {
  node "Docker Compose" {
    node "frontend container" {
      component "Vite / Svelte\nport 5173" as Frontend
    }

    node "backend container" {
      component "Django API\nport 8000" as Backend
    }

    database "PostgreSQL\nport 5432" as Postgres
  }
}

Frontend --> Backend : HTTP JSON
Backend --> Postgres : SQL

@enduml
